# druxt #3309969: configure/extend exposed JSON:API resources.
#
# https://www.drupal.org/i/3309969
# https://git.drupalcode.org/project/druxt/-/merge_requests/24
#
# Taken from the merge request diff, with the hunks for files a packaged
# release does not ship removed, because patch cannot apply those and stops:
#   .cspell.json, .github/workflows/test.yml, CHANGELOG.md
#
# Dogfooding the configurable resource list. This site exposes
# editor--editor and filter_format--filter_format, which stock Druxt does
# not, so the editor can read the toolbar and filters a text format is
# configured for instead of baking them into the build.
